he past few days of the dollar being offered and the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  strengthening," said one dealer.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spent $1.077 billion on \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in March, lower than $1.73 billion in February. It spent far less on \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the first quarter of this year -- $4.418 billion, than in the last quarter of 2008 -- $10.284 billion.\par \par \uc2 UKRAINE-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 / (UPDATE 2)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020090510e557000bj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
