\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine \highlight\uc2  cbank to  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2 , hold auctions next week\b0\par\par\uc2 173 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2009\par 17:12\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 KIEV, March 27 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will offer to sell dollars at 7.9 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday on the interbank market and buy at 7.7 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  -- at levels unchanged for several weeks, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  data showed.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  held a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  auction on Friday, selling dollars at 7.8 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  to banks that need to sell dollars on to individuals so that they can repay debt. These auctions are aimed at cooling down the cash \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 The price at the auction was also unchanged since February. The bank sold $37.6 million.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  traded slightly weaker on Friday, in a range to 8.4 per dollar. At the beginning of the week it was trading stronger than 8.35/$.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it would hold \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  auctions next Wednesday and Friday -- as it did this week -- and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the rest of the days.\par \par \uc2 (Editing by Ruth Pitchford)\par \par \uc2 UKRAINE-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 /|LANGEN|ABN|M|D   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020090330e53r001ft\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal25