\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Ukraine c.bank sells dlrs for consumer debt only\b0\par\par\uc2 238 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Februar 2009\par 13:40\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (adds total sales, rates for Monday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 KIEV, Feb 27 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold dollars at an auction on Friday for 7.8 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2 , limiting banks' use of their purchases strictly to repaying foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  loans taken out by individuals.\par \par \uc2 The bank later said it had sold $34.53 million in the auction, the first at which the stipulation on individuals' loans was imposed.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell sharply at the end of 2008, losing 50 percent of its value at one point, and has continued to lose ground since the New Year as the global downturn has sent Ukraine's steel-producing economy into a nosedive and politicians have resisted meeting the terms of an IMF loan. [ID:nLR866694]\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was trading at 8.5/8.6 on the interbank market on Friday.\par \par \uc2 The bank also issued its standard proposal to buy dollars on Monday, while \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the interbank market, at 7.70 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  and sell at 7.90. The rates were unchanged from those during the bank's \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  this week.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the market from Monday to Thursday to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  and has generally held auctions on Fridays for the sale of dollars. (Reporting by Natalya Zinets, writing by Ron Popeski; Editing by Ruth Pitchford)\par \par \uc2 UKRAINE-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 / (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020090227e52r00149\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
