\par\par \b \uc2 UDPATE 1-Ukraine cbank offers to sell dlrs at 7.58  \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 216 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Dezember 2008\par 09:58\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds change in rate, presidential adviser's comments)\par \par \uc2 KIEV, Dec 29 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the interbank market on Monday, selling dollars at 7.63 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the bank's data and dealers said.\par \par \uc2 The bank had offered to sell dollars at 7.58 earlier in the day but changed that rate, according to its data provided to Reuters. It did not say why the rate was changed.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly to rein in the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's fall. At one point this month, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  stood at half its September value to the dollar, touching 10/$.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  was trading at 7.57-7.67/$ on Monday and dealers said it was likely to slowly strengthen in the coming weeks.\par \par \uc2 A top economic aide to President Viktor Yushchenko said the rate was close to stabilising.\par \par \uc2 "Trades on Friday finished at 7.6 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  to the dollar. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's official rate is 7.7 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It seems to me that we are close to a balanced rate which no doubt will be supported until the end of the year," Oleksander Shlapak said.\par \par \uc2 (Editing by Ruth Pitchford)\par \par \uc2 UKRAINE-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 / (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA00