\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine \highlight\uc2  C.bank resumes  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  to prop  \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 230 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Dezember 2008\par 09:29\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  (adds details, background)\par \par \uc2  KIEV, Dec 16 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday resumed its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the interbank market, where the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is under severe pressure, offering to buy dollars at 7.64 and sell at 7.66.\par \par \uc2  The bank at the same time issued a directive authorising dollar sales only to meet client import contract obligations.\par \par \uc2  The announcement prompted an immediate rise in the hyrvnia to 7.7-7.0 after the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  had opened at 8.0/8.2.\par \par \uc2  The bank last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly on Nov. 21, selling dollars at 6.17 with no limitations on sales.\par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has also conducted \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  auctions for the dollar for the past three weeks on Wednesdays, selling dollars without announcing a starting price in advance.\par \par \uc2  At the last auction on Dec. 10 a total of $90.4 million was sold at an average rate of 7.53 compared to $93.3 million at 7.39 a week earlier.\par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  has plunged more than 70 percent since the start of September, when the impact of the global financial crisis took hold in the region. During a 1998 \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis, the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  fell 82 percent.  (Reporting by Natalya Zinets, writing by Ron Popeski, editing by Victoria Main)  \par \par \uc2 UKRAINE-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 / (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020081219e4cg000l0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
