\par\par \b \uc2 INTERVIEW- \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine \highlight\uc2  cbank to continue with unlimited  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  action\b0\par\par\uc2 By Natalya Zinets   \par \uc2 457 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 Oktober 2008\par 10:45\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  figure, dealers, more cbank quotes)\par \par \uc2 KIEV, Oct 31 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets by buying and selling unlimited amounts of dollars, First Deputy Chairman Anatoly Shapovalov told Reuters on Friday.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  every day for the past two weeks to try to prop the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which slipped on Wednesday to a historic low of 7.2 to the dollar. It has since bounced back and was quoted at 5.86-5.95 on Friday.\par \par \uc2 Shapovalov said a requirement for banks to sell dollars at the rate at which they had bought them from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would remain in force for several days. It offered to sell dollars at 5.95 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday and at 6.05 on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 "We \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  yesterday, selling $500 million dollars. We therefore demand that if they bought from \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, they then meet client orders at that rate and their profit is the commission," he said.\par \par \uc2 "Today, we will send a letter saying that dollars bought today at 5.95 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  have to be sold at 5.95 ... This is meant to calm the market. At the very least, this will happen today, tomorrow, and then we will see."\par \par \uc2 A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official said the bank had sold just under $40 million on Friday -- a sharp fall from Thursday's $500 million.\par \par \uc2 MARKETS CALM\par \par \uc2 President Viktor Yushchenko's office on Thursday criticised the bank's failure to stabilise the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  despite selling $5 billion in the past three weeks.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves were worth $37.5 billion at the end of September. Officials have since then have said the reserves stood at $33-34 billion.\par \par \uc2 Dealers said offering unlimited funds had helped calm the market and brought the interbank rate up to the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate -- something the bank's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  had failed to manage in the past two weeks.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  clearly managed to calm the market. Following the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  were other sellers," one dealer said.\par \par \uc2 Dealers and analysts had earlier said the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  slid to record lows because the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had not met all dollar demand, while at the same time providing large amounts of refinancing -- thus giving banks the means to buy the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has given banks refinancing worth 26 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  ($4.6 billion) so far in October in comparison to just 6 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  in September. (Reporting by Natalya Zinets, writing by Sabina Zawadzi, editing by Swaha Pattanaik)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 UKRAINE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 /\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 2,INTERVIEW)|LANGEN|C|D|E|M|O|U|MTL|GRO|SOF|OIL|G|RBN|BNX   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020081031e4av001jb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
