($2.23 billion), almost double the amount for the whole month of September.\par \par \uc2 The bank also said its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves, at $37.5 billion covers 3.7 months of imports.\par \par \uc2 "This demonstrates solid reserves that are enough to smooth out \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  fluctuations on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market," the bank said in a statement. (Reporting by Natalya ZInets; writing by Sabina Zawadzki)\par \par \uc2 UKRAINE-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 / (UDPATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|BNX   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020081017e4ae001vz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
