\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine \highlight\uc2  cbank offers dlrs, loans, stocks halted\b0\par\par\uc2 By Natalya Zinets   \par \uc2 561 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Oktober 2008\par 16:05\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers, president adviser)\par \par \uc2 KIEV, Oct 10 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold dollars on Friday at 5.0 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the third day running to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and continued to refinance banks, dealers and the bank said.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  strengthened to 4.98-5.30, within a newly widened forecast of 4.554-5.346. It hit an all-time low on Wednesday at 5.9 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2 , rising only after \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold dollars and we can say that thanks to that the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  strengthened," one dealer said. Traders had said in recent days that despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  remained stubbornly weak.\par \par \uc2 Local media estimated that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold $475 million in Thursday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , $200 million a day earlier and $343 million last Friday.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  never reveals the values. Dealers were not able to assess how much the bank sold on Friday.\par \par \uc2 A senior aide to President Viktor Yushchenko suggested that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  enough.\par \par \uc2 "Stability has to be supported through instruments such as high liquidity and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  participation on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, which unfortunately is not what we always see," said the deputy head of the president's secretariat, Andriy Goncharu.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  have always been positive from the point of view of balancing the market," he told a briefing.\par \par \uc2 REFINANCING\par \par \uc2 As the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  remains weak and lending grinds to a halt on global markets, analysts are concerned whether Ukrainian banks are able to refinance their debts.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  data showed it spent a further 1.34 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  (about $270 million) on Thursday to refinance banks, including a 1 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  one-year loan at 12 percent to an unnamed bank.\par \par \uc2 This week, the bank has already lent 1.5 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  to Nadra bank, in the process of repaying a $100 million Eurobond and a $130 million syndicated loan, and 1 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  to an unnamed bank.\par \par \uc2 It has previously said it would loan 5 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  to the country's sixth largest bank, Prominvest, placed in receivership this week following an ownership dispute that led to a run on the bank.\par \par \uc2 Total refinancing in the first nine days of the month amounted to 7.79 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  ($1.6 billion) -- more than the total for September at 5.96 billion \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Alfa Bank Ukraine, part of Russia's \uc2 Alfa Group\uc2 , was the latest bank to confirm it received refinancing in recent days, getting 440 million \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It successfully paid up a syndicated loan of $61 million late last month.\par \par \uc2 The credit crisis has also led many to wonder how the government will finance its projected $3.9 billion budget deficit this year. But finance ministry data showed a budget surplus of $649 million after the first nine months of the year.\par \par \uc2 As stock markets around the world fell dramatically, Ukraine's PFTS bourse was one of several to shut down completely until Monday.\par \par \uc2 The index has lost 41 percent since the start of September, when investors began pulling out of the region and 73 percent since the New Year after rising over 130 percent last year. (Writing by Sabina Zawadzki; editing by Chris Pizzey and Andy Bruce)\par \par \uc2 UKRAINE-MARKETS/ (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020081013e4aa001bx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
