\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 3- \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine \highlight\uc2  cbank offers dlrs after record  \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia \highlight\uc2  low\b0\par\par\uc2 By Natalya Zinets   \par \uc2 504 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Oktober 2008\par 10:55\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief, dealers)\par \par \uc2 KIEV, Oct 8 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold dollars on Wednesday at 5.0 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  to lift the 12-year-old \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from an all-time low of 5.9/$, dealers said.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Chairman Volodymyr Stelmakh was quoted as saying that the bank would sell dollars at auctions which could take place every day to ensure firms could buy key imports. He also said Ukrainian banks had no problems with liquidity.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  began sliding at the beginning of September when the impact of the global financial crisis on emerging markets became sharper, as investors scrambled for dollars and sentiment towards the region turned sour after Russia's war with Georgia.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's deputy chairman, Oleksander Savchenko, said on Tuesday the bank would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to strengthen the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  to 5.0/$ "very quickly". But the bank kept agitated dealers in suspense before making its offer.\par \par \uc2 "The bank sold a lot more than last time," one dealer said. "If it sold to all banks, then we'll probably hold to this level of 5.5-5.6."\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  last \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday, selling $342 million for the first time since February at 5.0 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The dealer said not all demand had been met by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's sales but the consequent stable level should be a sign to exporters to sell dollars and not wait for a higher price.\par \par \uc2 "Theoretically, we should see some exporters, as long as they have something to sell," the dealer said.\par \par \uc2 Stelmakh told Interfax Ukraine news agency that the bank had bought billions of dollars in recent months and was now ready to sell them.\par \par \uc2 "We are going to carry out auctions to sell \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . But they will be based on the needs of (importers of) raw materials critical for our economy -- gas, oil, oil products and also the import of industrial equipment," Stelmakh said.\par \par \uc2 He said apart from the country's sixth largest bank, Prominvest, placed in receivership on Wednesday, [ID:nL8638256] "other banks have no problems with liquidity".\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will unquestionably support banks but on condition that the bank properly conducts its business."\par \par \uc2 CAUTIOUS DEALERS\par \par \uc2 Dealers made no connection between the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's weakness and political events in Ukraine, which is facing its third election in as many years after the collapse of the ruling coalition of parties linked to the 2004 "Orange Revolution".\par \par \uc2 President Viktor Yushchenko gave parties more time to find a solution after consultations, though politicians leaving a meeting on Wednesday said everyone appeared resigned to a snap poll.\par \par \uc2 One dealer said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had sent banks a letter late on Tuesday warning them it had the authority to discipline them for irresponsible dollar rates at street exchange bureaux. (Additional reporting by Carolyn Cohn in London, writing by Sabina Zawadzki; editing by Stephen Nisbet)\par \par \uc2 UKRAINE-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 / (UPDATE 3)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020081008e4a8000og\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
