\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine \highlight\uc2  cbank sells dlrs, cautious on  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 By Natalya Zinets   \par \uc2 483 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Oktober 2008\par 10:21\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds cbank comments, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 KIEV, Oct 3 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold $342 million in dollars at 5.0 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday but said it would not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  systematically on the interbank market, the bank's top adviser said.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  has weakened considerably in recent weeks from around 4.5 to the dollar in May and June, hitting a 3-1/2-year low of 5.11-5.12 on Wednesday. It had been trading at 5.18-5.26 per dollar when the bank offered to sell dollars earlier.\par \par \uc2 "We sold $342 million today," \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  adviser Valery Lytvytsky told Reuters. "We don't want waves, especially if those waves are psychological ... We wanted to psychologically remove nervousness from the market.\par \par \uc2 "This does not mean that we will systematically \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the market," he said. "We will come to the market again when a number of factors give us a reason."\par \par \uc2 He said factors included the "psychological mood" of the market, the global financial situation, needs of large companies such as state energy firm Naftogaz which needs dollars to pay for gas, foreign investor activity, liquidity and the budget.\par \par \uc2 "We wanted to give some sort of positive signal, but wanted to warn you, do not expect the old tune from us. Today, there is a new tune and this is crossing over to a flexible exchange rate," he said.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  let the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  fluctuate more freely in February after it abandoned a three-year policy of keeping it in a strict corridor 5.00-5.06 to the dollar.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  steadily crept up to the dollar, but lost all of those gains as investors lost the taste for risk and scrambled for dollars at a time of higher tensions with Russia and a domestic political crisis.\par \par \uc2 Several \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials have indicated in the past week that the bank may not strictly keep to its view that the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  should be kept to between 4.656-5.044/$.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Council head Petro Poroshenko said he saw no reason for a significant drop in the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , on the day international ratings agency Fitch cut its outlook on Ukraine to negative, citing rising risk of a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis.\par \par \uc2 On Thusrday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's deputy chairman, Oleksander Savchenko, said the bank would not prop up the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  for now because much of the weakness was temporary and any such move could deepen the current account gap by stimulating imports.\par \par \uc2 The bank on Thursday released a statement to say it would not spend its reserves when speculators were in the market, but could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to help with purchases of crucial imports and payments for external debt. (Writing by Sabina Zawadzki, Editing by Andy Bruce)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 UKRAINE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 /\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|BNX   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020081006e4a3000kv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
