\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2-Ukraine C.Bank buys dollars at 4.75  \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 295 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Juni 2008\par 16:05\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (adds new official rate)\par \par \uc2 KIEV, June 20 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Friday, buying dollars at 4.75 \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was the first since the bank bought the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at 4.82 on June 12.\par \par \uc2 "It had been some time since the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but today it satisfied all client orders at 4.75," said one dealer.\par \par \uc2 The dollar had slipped on the interbank market to 4.67-4.68 from 4.7 on Thursday. Dealers said demand for \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnias\b0 \highlight\uc2  had risen ahead of the deadline for banks to meet reserve requirements.\par \par \uc2 Another dealer said \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchases totalled no more than $100 million dollars as most clients were unwilling to sell large amounts at such a rate.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  then announced its latest official rate for the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  -- 4.8497 to the dollar valid from Monday, June 23 against the previous rate of 4.8525 on Friday.\par \par \uc2 Dealers offered no forecasts on whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would, as a result of the latest \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , proceed with further upward movements of the official \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate.\par \par \uc2 "How can you take a guess if the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  says nothing about how it arrives at setting its official rate?" said one.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  altered its exchange rate policy in May, ending a three-year-old practice of keeping the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  within a corridor of 5.0-5.06.\par \par \uc2 The official rate of 5.05 was initially revalued to 4.85 and has since undergone minor adjustments. (Reporting by Natalya Zinets, writing by Ron Popeski; Editing by Ron Askew)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 UKRAINE\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 /\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 2)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|BNX   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020080620e46k001az\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
