 by Ron Askew)\par \par \uc2 UKRAINE-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 /C.BANK (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020080603e463000fl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
