\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine \highlight\uc2  cbank fails to  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  as  \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia \highlight\uc2  jumps   \b0\par\par\uc2 417 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2008\par 18:28\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 KIEV, March 21 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Ukraine\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  firmed against the dollar to its strongest since August 2005 without any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , far exceeding the 5.00/$ level at which the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  normally steps in, dealers said on Friday.   \par \par \uc2 The bank has bought or sold dollars since 2005 to guard the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  <UAH=> at 5.00-5.06/$, and had adopted a wider corridor of 4.95-5.25, which the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  also crossed on Friday to peak at 4.915 to the dollar.   \par \par \uc2 No comment was available from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday. Two \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials said earlier this week that there was no question of revaluation at the moment, despite Ukraine's soaring inflation rate and the dollar's drop in the past two weeks to record lows against the euro.   \par \par \uc2 Both said revaluation would hit exports, exacerbating Ukraine's trade gap which boosted the current account deficit threefold last year.   \par \par \uc2 Dealers said they were left confused as to why the bank had not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , especially after numerous statements in recent weeks by officials that the bank is not considering revaluation or any other change in its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy.   \par \par \uc2 "There was an element of uncertainty on the interbank market due to the absence of reaction from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Interbusiness Consulting brokerage said.   \par \par \uc2 "This causes a panicked mood both among market participants and citizens as to the future rate of the dollar to the \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which in turn opens the door to unjustified speculation."   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is known to have left the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  alone when it slips beyond the tight band, but only when it is sure the situation would return back to normal soon.   \par \par \uc2 "Why didn't the bank \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ? What happened? It's difficult to say. The spreads were really wide, there was speculation on the market, everything," said one dealer.   \par \par \uc2 "The dollar supply was higher than the demand, but not to such an extent for the rate to rise so high."   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 hryvnia\b0 \highlight\uc2  strengthened beyond its ceiling last Friday, when the bank also did not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but dealers assumed the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  would drop back into its bracket.   \par \par \uc2 "Panic began to grow from the start of this week. People from the small banks began saying that managers ordered to annul \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  positions, because there would be a revaluation," said another dealer. (Reporting by Natalya Zinets; Writing by Sabina Zawadzki; Editing by Ruth Pitchford)   \par \par \uc2 UKRAINE-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 /|LANGEN|ABN|M|D   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020080321e43l000si\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
